  Hand-authored for usd-roadnetwork-plugins; no third-party content.
  The ODR-02 minimal network: a straight road with a lane-section change
  (road 1), a junction (100) with one connecting road (10), and a road with
  an arc and a line (2). Road 1 rises along a non-zero elevation, road 2 has
  a non-zero lane offset and an all-zero superelevation, and each warning
  kind the decoder reports appears once or twice. The expected model is in
  tests/test_decoder.cpp.
-->
